PhysicalStockInitSystem: recettes de production physique:
  cloth(id=8) <- 1 wool(id=6)
  tools(id=9) <- 0,5 iron(id=5) + 0,5 wood(id=4)
  weapons(id=10) <- 0,8 iron(id=5) + 0,4 coal(id=7)
  paper(id=11) <- 1,2 wood(id=4)
Justification ratios: Ratios early-modern plausibles (affinables): cloth 1:1 wool (masse filée/tissée); tools 0.5 iron + 0.5 wood (tête + manche); weapons 0.8 iron + 0.4 coal (forge); paper 1.2 wood (perte pulpe). Primaires (grain/fish/livestock/wood/iron/wool/coal) et luxes sans recette = extraction sans intrant transformé.
